- @page_title = 'Clone on Nitrous.IO buttons'

%h3
  Clone on Nitrous.IO

.info
  %p
    Add a "Clone on Nitrous.IO" button to your source code repository's project
    page to help your users get started using or contributing to your project
    quickly.

  .step
    %h4 Step 1: Select Your Repository Type

    %input{type: 'radio', name: 'scm', id: 'scm-git', value: 'git', checked: true}
    %label{for: 'scm-git'} Git

    %input{type: 'radio', name: 'scm', id: 'scm-hg', value: 'hg'}
    %label{for: 'scm-hg'} Mercurial

  .step
    %h4 Step 2: Select Your Project Type

    %input{type: 'radio', name: 'type', id: 'type-ruby', value: 'ruby', checked: true}
    %label{for: 'type-ruby'} Ruby

    %input{type: 'radio', name: 'type', id: 'type-nodejs', value: 'nodejs'}
    %label{for: 'type-nodejs'} Node.js

    %input{type: 'radio', name: 'type', id: 'type-other', value: 'other'}
    %label{for: 'type-other'} Others

  .step
    %h4 Step 3: Get Your Code

    %p
      Paste the button's HTML or Markdown into your project's README or website.

    %h5 HTML

    %textarea{readonly: true}
      <a href="https://www.nitrous.io/clone/SCM-TYPE/?url=CLONE-URL"><img src="https://www.nitrous.io/assets/clone-on-nitrous.png" alt="Clone on Nitrous.IO" /></a>

    %h5
      Markdown

    %textarea{readonly: true}
      [![Clone on Nitrous.IO](https://www.nitrous.io/assets/clone-on-nitrous.png)](https://www.nitrous.io/clone/SCM-TYPE/?url=CLONE-URL)

= content_for :page_script do
  = javascript_include_tag 'pages/clone_embed'
  :coffeescript
    new AIO.CloneEmbed()
